/*
CharacterRoom 1.0.2. Character chat for NovelAI's xialong-v1.
Forked from AnotherRoom 1.1.5 by Triplis, with permission.
AnotherRoom credits: LtLi0n (TypeScript help), Moonbow (UI design), Moonbow and FurbyMask
(early testing), SomethingRoom script (AeR-like scaffolding).

Frontmatter values must not contain colons.
Top-level code runs in order at load: declare anything read during load above its first reader.

SECTIONS (search "SECTION <NAME>")
  NAMES       random-name helpers, forum placeholder, permissions
  TYPES       globals, enums, card and schedule types, real-time keys
  CR-SIDEGEN  depth counter around every CR-started generation; crSerial; shared constants
  JOTS        per-pairing facts
  FLOATY      floaty brains
  DIARIES     Diary, Plans, Forum, Imitate, Process
  CROP        image crop and resize
  GAMES       game data, stats, reactions
  EDITOR      emotion dimming, name bold, AnotherRoom's image widgets
  CHATSET     chat settings record
  MACROS      macro expansion, field formatting
  K           the kernel: context assembly, parity-tested against AnotherRoom 1.1.5
  CR-CLOCK    chat clock, real or story time
  HOOKS-MISC  onGenerationEnd, onHistoryNavigated
  K-CONTEXT   onBeforeContextBuild and onContextBuilt, adapters over K
  CR-DATA     CR-only card fields and import sanitizers
  CR-BUBBLE   chat bubble look: record, resolver, the message segmenter, shaped markers
  CR-UI       shell window, tokens, surfaces, editor portraits, report
  CR-IMG      image settings, prompt chunks, slot generation
  CR-SCAN     story scan, cast detection, architect and enhance passes
  CR-ILLUS    illustrator
  CR-ARGEN    doors for AnotherRoom's generators
  CR-POSTS    the Contact's feed
  CR-CHATIMG  photos in chat: brain, tag, dispatch, anchors
  CR-GROUP    group chat through persona helper scripts
  CR-RPG      Games tab: dice systems, sheets, resources, reactions, dice faces, odds
  CR-PLAY     AnotherRoom's Rock Paper Scissors and Number Guess, as shell surfaces
  BRIDGE      bridge transport and handshake
  CR-GALLERY  stored images
  CR-STAGE    visual-novel view of the chat
  MACRO-UI    macro list
  SCENARIO / USER / CONTACT   card templates, save, import and export
  BUBBLES     markdown helpers, response parser
  LISTINGS    deletion prompt builder
  STARTUP     ui.register, onScriptsLoaded
  NAMES-DATA  name tables

HOOKS
  onBeforeContextBuild, onContextBuilt (K-CONTEXT); onGenerationEnd, onHistoryNavigated
  (HOOKS-MISC); onScriptsLoaded (STARTUP); onGenerationRequested, onResponse (CR-GROUP).
  K-CONTEXT and the generation-end tail do nothing while crGroupGenDepth > 0.

STORAGE
  account  characterListKey userListKey scenarioListKey defaultAuthorKey useImageDecoKey
           useEmotionalModesKey emojiRefKey gameRecordKey includeGameStatsKey cr.stage
           cr.rpg.rulesets
  story    chatSettingsKey trackRealTimeKey trackRealTimeRecordKey rememberMeKey
           floatyBrainsKey floatyBrainsStateKey floatyActiveIdsKey floatyInactiveIdsKey
           diaryBrainsRecordKey actionPlansRecordKey forumThreadsRecordKey
           emotionalMemoryRecordKey continuityCreationRecordKey cr.clockMode cr.clockStep
           cr.group cr.rpg
  history  cr.clock (undo rewinds the chat clock)
  temp     lastCropValuesTempKey, game display keys

BRIDGE MESSAGES (channel "hypebot", envelope {type, sid, payload})
  to bridge    HANDSHAKE_REQUEST AE_CHAR_IMAGE_ACTION GENERATE_IMAGE AE_GALLERY_INDEX_REQ
               AE_GALLERY_ACTION AE_IMG_META_REQ AE_CARD_IMPORT
  from bridge  HANDSHAKE_ACK AE_VIEWPORT AE_CHAR_IMAGE_SLOTS AE_GALLERY_INDEX_RESP
               AE_IMG_META_RESP AE_CARD_IMPORT_RESULT
  The bridge also writes --ce-img-ar onto the nearest [data-ce-ar-host] when it paints.

HELPER MESSAGES (channel "cr-persona-helper", flat {type, sid, ...})
  PH_HELLO PH_PING PH_WAKE PH_PONG PH_RUN PH_DONE. Change both scripts or neither.
*/

// ============================================================================
// SECTION NAMES — RANDOM-NAME HELPERS, FORUM PLACEHOLDER, PERMISSIONS
// ============================================================================
function getRandomNameFull()
{
  return getRandomNameThey() + " " + getRandomNameSurname();
}

function getRandomNameThey()
{
  const gender = api.v1.random.int(0, 1);
  if (gender === 0){
    return getRandomNameMale();
  }
  else if (gender === 1){
    return getRandomNameFemale();
  }
}

function getRandomNameMale() : string
{
  const min = 0;
  const max = NAMES_LIST_MALE.length - 1;
  const index = api.v1.random.int(min, max);
  return NAMES_LIST_MALE[index];
}

function getRandomNameFemale() : string
{
  const min = 0;
  const max = NAMES_LIST_FEMALE.length - 1;
  const index = api.v1.random.int(min, max);
  return NAMES_LIST_FEMALE[index];
}

function getRandomNameSurname() : string
{
  const min = 0;
  const max = NAMES_LIST_SURNAMES.length - 1;
  const index = api.v1.random.int(min, max);
  return NAMES_LIST_SURNAMES[index];
}

